  "_about": [
    "The people of Spanning: one list for the whole character pipeline (PLAN 1.3, 5.4).",
    "look: how tools/blender/build_character.py builds <id>.glb from the CC0 Quaternius pack (PLAN 1.3a;",
    "  sex f|m, height m crown to sole, build 0 slim..1 heavy, skin/hair/eye/brow colours sRGB 0..255,",
    "  hair_style bob|short|receding|buzz|ponytail|buns, beard full|short, glasses, outfit",
    "  business|shirt|manager|monteur, helmet (monteur), stubble 0..1 (scripted method only),",
    "  stoop 0..1 (age), colors: garment colour overrides). The ids, the glb names and office stay",
    "  whatever builds them.",
    "office: where the world puts them (game/src/world/office/office_people.gd), in the office's",
    "  Godot space (x, z): seat (a workstation in the office model: <seat>_desk and <seat>_chair),",
    "  or at + face, or route (walked back and forth); pose sit|idle|talk|walk; missions: present",
    "  only while one of these missions is active; after: away until one of these missions is done; talk: coach opens the coach instead of a talk;",
    "  floor: its floor (the start floor when none); chair: a chair marker, sat on facing its way; headset;",
    "  lunch: a second spot (with its own floor), the kantine, for lunch; without one they lunch at their desk.",
    "day: their working day (office_day.gd, PLAN 2.14 S1-A), times HH:MM: arrive (by the lift or the stairs,",
    "  the front door on the begane grond), coffee (10 min at the floor's coffee corner), lunch (30 min at the",
    "  lunch spot), leave; late_until (optional) keeps them later, else the simulation does (load or morale).",
    "  Without a day (or a bad one) a default per person; people tied to missions keep to the story.",
    "Names and roles follow the dialog spec (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-15-dialog-system-design.md 6)."
